("'Hardly had she left ___ the phone rang.'","than|when|then|that",1,"'Hardly... when' pairs.","Usage"),
("Which revision best combines: 'The storm hit. The power failed.'","The storm hit and the power failed.|The storm hit, the power failed.|Hitting the storm, power failed.|The storm hit so the power failed and.",0,"The comma-splice-free compound with 'and'.","Sentence structure"),
